id: pm-brief-github-7e06b2eb1b44-135
title: Enforce the requested brief budget after the final compaction step
description: "GH issue #135: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/issues/135 · author @unbraind · state reason completed · created 2026-10-05T05:06:12Z · updated 2026-10-09T09:17:10Z"
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[2]: "gh:unbraind/pm-brief#135","github_author:unbraind"
created_at: "2026-10-17T07:53:52.566Z"
